    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Park Simulator</strong> is a relaxing, immersive stroll through beautifully designed urban park where you can unwind, explore, and take in serene landscapes. Step into the shoes of a casual walker as you meander through lush green paths, quiet lakesides, and vibrant gardens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> No objectives, timers, or pressure\u2014just pure relaxation as you explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and casual experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who want to take a virtual break and reconnect with nature without leaving their home. Step outside\u2014virtually\u2014whenever you need to find a moment of peace.</p>",
